    {
      "id": "p4-three-primitives",
      "eyebrow": "核心概念",
      "title": "MCP 三大核心原语",
      "content": {
        "kind": "table",
        "headers": [
          "原语",
          "能力",
          "典型应用"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "Tools",
            "list / call",
            "执行操作：查询、自动化、测试"
          ],
          [
            "Resources",
            "list / read / subscribe",
            "数据源：文件、数据库 schema、配置"
          ],
          [
            "Prompts",
            "list / get",
            "模板化消息与指令，定制化交互"
          ]
        ],
        "note": "所有调用统一通过 /messages 端点进行（基于 JSON-RPC 2.0）"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "MCP 协议定义了三大核心原语，理解它们就理解了 MCP 的本质。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-three-primitives-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第一个是 Tools，工具。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-three-primitives-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Tools 支持列表和调用两类能力，用于执行各种操作，比如查询、自动化、测试。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-three-primitives-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第二个是 Resources，资源。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-three-primitives-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Resources 支持列表、读取、订阅，用于暴露数据或上下文，比如文件、数据库 schema、配置等。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-three-primitives-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第三个是 Prompts，提示。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-three-primitives-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "Prompts 支持列表和获取，是服务器提供的结构化消息模板，用于定制化 LLM 交互。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-three-primitives-s6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "所有这些调用，都统一通过 /messages 端点进行，基于 JSON-RPC 2.0 规范。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p4-three-primitives-s7.mp3"
        }
      ],
      "fragments": [
