    {
      "id": "p5-connection-flow",
      "eyebrow": "协议流程",
      "title": "MCP 连接初始化流程（HTTP SSE 示例）",
      "content": {
        "kind": "code",
        "language": "http",
        "lines": [
          {
            "code": "GET /sse HTTP/1.1",
            "comment": "① 客户端发起 SSE 长连接",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "event: endpoint\ndata: {\"url\":\"/messages?sessionId=xxx\"}",
            "comment": "② 服务端推送消息端点 URL",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"method\":\"initialize\",...}",
            "comment": "③ 客户端协商能力与版本",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"id\":1,\"result\":{\"capabilities\":{...}}}",
            "comment": "④ 服务端返回初始化响应",
            "highlight": null
          },
          {
            "code": "{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"notifications/initialized\"}",
            "comment": "⑤ 客户端发送 initialized 通知",
            "highlight": null
          }
        ],
        "note": "基于 JSON-RPC 2.0，支持 stdio、HTTP SSE、WebSocket 等多种传输方式"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "现在我们看看 MCP 的连接初始化流程，以 HTTP SSE 为例。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p5-connection-flow-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第一步，客户端向 /sse 端点发起 GET 请求，建立 SSE 长连接。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p5-connection-flow-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第二步，服务端生成唯一的 sessionId，并通过 endpoint 事件推送消息端点 URL。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p5-connection-flow-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第三步，客户端向消息端点发起 initialize 请求，用于协商能力和版本。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p5-connection-flow-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第四步，服务端返回包含 capabilities、serverInfo、instructions 的初始化响应。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p5-connection-flow-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第五步，客户端发送 initialized 通知，标志握手完成。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p5-connection-flow-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "整个流程基于 JSON-RPC 2.0 规范，支持双向通信。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p5-connection-flow-s6.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "除了 HTTP SSE，MCP 还支持 stdio、WebSocket 等多种传输方式。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p5-connection-flow-s7.mp3"
        }
      ],
