    {
      "id": "p6-advanced-features",
      "eyebrow": "扩展能力",
      "title": "MCP 高级特性一览",
      "content": {
        "kind": "table",
        "headers": [
          "特性",
          "能力",
          "应用场景"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "Sampling",
            "服务器内部嵌套调用 LLM",
            "Agent 多步自动化"
          ],
          [
            "Progress",
            "带外进度通知",
            "长时间任务进度反馈"
          ],
          [
            "Pagination",
            "cursor 分页",
            "大规模结果集流式返回"
          ],
          [
            "Cancellation",
            "取消进行中的请求",
            "中断耗时操作"
          ],
          [
            "资源订阅",
            "subscribe / updated 通知",
            "数据变更实时推送"
          ]
        ],
        "note": "会话管理：60 分钟超时，使用 DelayQueue 自动清理"
      },
      "script": [
        {
          "text": "MCP 还提供了丰富的高级特性，让 AI 能力更强大。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p6-advanced-features-s0.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第一个是 Sampling，允许服务器内部嵌套发起 LLM 调用，实现 Agent 化的多步自动化。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p6-advanced-features-s1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第二个是 Progress，支持带外进度通知，通过 progressToken 关联原请求，适合长时间任务。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p6-advanced-features-s2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第三个是 Pagination，使用 cursor 进行分页，支持大规模结果集流式返回。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p6-advanced-features-s3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第四个是 Cancellation，任一方都可发送 cancelled 通知来取消进行中的请求。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p6-advanced-features-s4.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "第五个是资源订阅，通过 subscribe 和 updated 通知机制，实现数据变更的实时推送。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p6-advanced-features-s5.mp3"
        },
        {
          "text": "此外，MCP 还有完善的会话管理机制，60 分钟超时，使用 DelayQueue 自动清理。",
          "audio": "audio/mcp-model-context-protocol/p6-advanced-features-s6.mp3"
        }
      ],
